  "実例": [
   {
    "quote": "For example, a screenshot of a threat actor’s forum post may preserve its visible content. But the screenshot alone may not establish when the post was accessed, whether the investigator was authenticated, or what information was visible elsewhere on the page.",
    "url": "https://authentic8.com/blog/osint-chain-of-custody-digital-evidence/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-06"
   },
   {
    "quote": "Investigative team or case assignment",
    "url": "https://authentic8.com/blog/osint-chain-of-custody-digital-evidence/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-06"
   },
   {
    "quote": "Associate evidence with the relevant case or investigation.",
    "url": "https://authentic8.com/blog/osint-chain-of-custody-digital-evidence/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-06"
   },
   {
    "quote": "For example, an investigator correlating a forum username with a social media profile should retain the underlying observations supporting that connection.",
    "url": "https://authentic8.com/blog/osint-chain-of-custody-digital-evidence/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-06"
   },
   {
    "quote": "For example, an investigator may capture a screenshot in one application, document its source in a spreadsheet, store the file in a shared folder, and communicate analytical context through a separate messaging platform.",
    "url": "https://authentic8.com/blog/osint-chain-of-custody-digital-evidence/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-06"
   },
   {
    "quote": "It is maintaining a consistent relationship between the evidence, the collection process, and the investigative decisions made throughout the case.",
    "url": "https://authentic8.com/blog/osint-chain-of-custody-digital-evidence/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-06"
   },
   {
    "quote": "Silo Case Manager supports the organization of investigation content and context, while Silo Drive provides capabilities for sharing collected material across authorized teams.",
    "url": "https://authentic8.com/blog/osint-chain-of-custody-digital-evidence/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-06"
   },
   {
    "quote": "This can help teams apply appropriate access controls, manage investigative resources, and support accountability across analysts and cases.",
    "url": "https://authentic8.com/blog/osint-chain-of-custody-digital-evidence/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-06"
   },
   {
    "quote": "Silo Case Manager and Silo Drive support evidence organization and team collaboration.",
    "url": "https://authentic8.com/blog/osint-chain-of-custody-digital-evidence/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-06"
   },
   {
    "quote": "Centralized workflows help preserve relationships between collected artifacts and case context.",
    "url": "https://authentic8.com/blog/osint-chain-of-custody-digital-evidence/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-06"
   },
   {
    "quote": "Legal admissibility depends on the applicable jurisdiction, rules of evidence, authentication requirements, collection methods, and circumstances of the case.",
    "url": "https://authentic8.com/blog/osint-chain-of-custody-digital-evidence/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-06"
   },
   {
    "quote": "For example, a preserved webpage capture may include a timestamp, source URL, and associated collection metadata. Those details can support authentication, but they do not automatically establish that the original webpage contained truthful information.",
    "url": "https://authentic8.com/blog/osint-chain-of-custody-digital-evidence/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-06"
   }
